      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "After a series of initial experiments and corrections, the scientist’s hard work paid off when the twin clone turkeys were hatched with normal feathers and claws. This breakthrough possibly enabled people to bring their adored pets back to life. However, it bothered him from time to time that their health was in poor condition because they were unable to resist illnesses.",
